WEBVTT

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:07.090
Remember how much thought went into choosing your first mortgage?

00:00:07.780 --> 00:00:12.510
You looked at your options, talked it through, and found what felt right for you.

00:00:13.320 --> 00:00:14.930
But then life gets busy.

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:18.810
And a few years later, your mortgage is coming up for renewal.

00:00:19.700 --> 00:00:22.700
It can be tempting just to stay with the lender you know.

00:00:23.510 --> 00:00:25.480
Don't just renew. Review.

00:00:26.190 --> 00:00:35.680
At MortgageEasy, we'll review the market for you, looking at the mortgages available and finding a suitable option with a competitive rate for your circumstances.

00:00:36.380 --> 00:00:38.850
Because a lot can change in a few years.

00:00:39.140 --> 00:00:46.560
We'll take the time to understand what's changed in your life, and make sure the advice you received last time is still relevant today.

00:00:47.490 --> 00:00:51.370
And sometimes, staying with your existing lender will still be the right choice.

00:00:52.370 --> 00:00:53.330
Sometimes it won't.

00:00:53.920 --> 00:00:55.370
The important thing is knowing.

00:00:55.700 --> 00:00:59.770
From today, and in the years ahead, until you're mortgage-free.

00:01:00.540 --> 00:01:04.630
Mortgage Easy is here from your first home throughout your mortgage journey.

00:01:05.360 --> 00:01:10.290
Helping you review your options, make informed choices, and save money where we can.

00:01:11.130 --> 00:01:12.920
Don't just renew. Review.
